    {
      "kind": "wiki",
      "evidence": "data/content/dungeons/robgoblin_treasure_trove.json: difficulty 2, zone 'Wilds (Robgoblin Camp, northern Wilds)', enemies ['Wizard Hildegarde', 'Robgoblins', 'Robgoblin Mages', 'Armored Robgoblins', 'Robgoblin Medics', 'Wizard Hildegarde']."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "Door at [-537.53, 26.04, 772.46]: BJX fork Battles.lua:12 (Npcs.json Id 46191, bw_hedge_door_01.adr). (R) the fork's own placement, not a captured one. Region The Wilds, place The Wilds."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reference",
      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 9 ('Robgoblin Treasure Trove (the live dungeon: robgoblin bruisers and wiz-ords through the trove, Wizard Hildegar'): scene sg_robgoblin_trove, entry, exit, 7 waves, 21 spawns ({'Robgoblin Bruiser': 10, 'Robgoblin Wiz-ord': 10, 'Wizard Hildegarde': 1})."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Every spot inside the scene is the fork's generated layout, not an original one. Zone number 1208 is the fork's; ours must be assigned and the scene sg_robgoblin_trove has not been loaded by our server yet (the eleven shipped battles all use sg_random_encounter_clearing). Triggers: at-start spawns are actors, later waves follow the one before (the fork's 1.5 s delay is dropped). Knockouts and score are the design's defaults; coins and XP are the shipped battles' values, not the fork's 30 coins / 140 stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Not proven in the client: this scene needs one native load, and the starter or door of `entry` is drawn by the entrances work, not by this file. Each kind's rank here decides its health and hit at the fight's tier. Door actor 100000046191: reference Npcs.json Id 46191, model 267, name 5697, at [-537.53, 26.04, 772.46]."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) The guide's main goal is the one goal shown from the start and is done with the fork's last goal; the steps before it stay, as the triggers of its waves and boss."
    },
    {
      "kind": "reconstructed",
      "evidence": "(R) Guide overlay by scripts/dungeon_fights.py from data/content/dungeons/robgoblin_treasure_trove.json."
    },
    {"kind": "wiki", "evidence": "L1194 (owner 2026-11-12: the end-of-battle prize wheel depends on the player's class): the wheel is this battle's own fanbyte page 'FR Place:Robgoblin Treasure Trove' (Prize Wheel Rewards, one list per class plus its General Purpose part; cached lab/references/fanbyte-battles-20261112/FR_Place_Robgoblin_Treasure_Trove.html). Each class's wheel holds its own items and the shared items; the coins are the page's. (R) The wiki's spelling read as the client's item: 'Wizards Ring of Regeneration II' as 'Wizard's Ring of Regeneration II'. It replaces every earlier note in this record about the prize wheel or its prizes."}
